      "topic": "results",
      "title": {
        "en": "Transformative off-leash obedience and manners"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report dramatic improvements in their dogs' behaviour following intensive training programmes. Pets that previously struggled with impulse control, pulling, or selective hearing learned reliable off-leash recall and calm household manners. Clients highlight successful outcomes across a wide variety of breeds and temperaments."
      },
      "mentions": 30,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "title": {
        "en": "Passionate and engaging training team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents overwhelmingly praise head trainer Gary and his team, including Tara and Kae, for their humour, dedication, and professional insight. Reviewers note that the staff immediately puts nervous dog owners at ease during initial evaluations. Clients appreciate working with trainers who demonstrate genuine passion for canine development."
      },
      "mentions": 27,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling across diverse breeds"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently highlight the team's ability to handle dogs of all breeds, sizes, and energy levels. Reviewers note that whether working with rambunctious standard poodles, high-drive rescue puppies, or giant Irish Wolfhounds, trainers build confidence and trust. The staff treats every canine visitor with patient care and genuine affection."
      },
      "mentions": 27,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What training options are offered at All Around K9 Training?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The facility offers board-and-train courses, private lessons, puppy foundation classes, and off-leash obedience programmes."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the training process begin?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Owners begin with a comprehensive in-person evaluation where trainers assess the dog's temperament and discuss customized training goals."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the trainer work with high-energy or large dog breeds?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers confirm successful training with energetic rescue dogs, working breeds, and large breeds including Irish Wolfhounds and bulldogs."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are pet parents instructed on how to handle their dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, client reviews highlight thorough one-on-one handover sessions where trainers teach owners how to reinforce obedience commands."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
